+### OS X
 
     $ TOR_SKIP_LAUNCH=1 TOR_SOCKS_PORT=9150 /path/to/Tor\ Browser/Contents/MacOS/firefox
 
+### Windows
+
+Create a shortcut with the `Target` set to:
+
